connection_error.description:
Home Assistant has been unable to reach the STIGA cloud for {failures} consecutive update cycles.

Last error: {error}

Please check your internet connection and verify that the STIGA service is available. This notice will disappear automatically once the connection is restored.

mqtt_connection_failed.description:
Home Assistant could not establish the real-time (MQTT) connection to the STIGA cloud, so live status and remote controls are unavailable. Periodic sensor polling still works.

Last error: {error}

The integration keeps retrying automatically; reload it if the problem persists.
